


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_9cc3b56d:


    "早上。宿舍玄关口。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_03e84ad9:


    "阳菜等人慌慌张张地打开了鞋盒。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_d3a4952d:



    voice "2SA_0221"
    sachiko "「要出门么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_832e8654:


    "手里拿着扫帚的祥子悠闲地问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_9896a855:



    voice "2HI_0532"
    hina "「去学校！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_5d3da41d:



    voice "2SA_0222"
    sachiko "「你们总是这么忙啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_9cf80981:



    voice "2HI_0533"
    hina "「你应该能猜到原因」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_761da605:



    voice "2MI_0385"
    miyako "「抱歉……」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_e90c8323:


    "不好意思的圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_15aef027:



    voice "2RI_0551RE"
    rin "「别管我了，你们先走！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_bfe86de1:



    voice "2HI_0534"
    hina "「你也给我反省吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_22403e23:



    voice "2FU_0464"
    fumi "「但是我觉得今天还是比平常更充裕一点」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_666e47a7:


    "祥子瞥了眼墙上的钟表。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_90af041a:



    voice "2SA_0223"
    sachiko "「确实，甚至不用跑去的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_0f9c9140:



    voice "2FU_0465"
    fumi "「大概。距离巴士发车还有一段时间」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_d987d52e:



    voice "2SA_0224"
    sachiko "「那太好了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_0e5e49c3:



    voice "2HI_0535"
    hina "「为什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_2fbf002c:



    voice "2SA_0225"
    sachiko "「因为积雪了」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_153dacfa:


    hina_rin "「真的假的！」\n「真的假的～」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_a8a7b790:


    "两个人截然相反的兴致。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_b7723417:



    voice "2SA_0226"
    sachiko "「嗯，积得比较厚的地方大概也就是一拳深吧。即使如此跑起来还是很危险」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_241d6bc3:



    voice "2FU_0466"
    fumi "「是的呢。我会小心的」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_43f6a935:


    "这里虽然算是个乡下，但还不是那种会因为暴雪而被封锁起来的乡下。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_dbcfe2ee:



    voice "2SA_0227"
    sachiko "「啊，小文。不好意思，能不能拜托你回来的时候去买点东西？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_8281d9d7:



    voice "2FU_0467"
    fumi "「好的，是今晚火锅的食材吧？要买点什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_40d54d20:



    voice "2SA_0228"
    sachiko "「谢了。我等会发到小文你的LIME上哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_2524d6c3:



    voice "2FU_0468B"
    fumi "「啊，最近电池不太中用，为了保险能发到群里吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_4ea8ed3c:



    voice "2SA_0229"
    sachiko "「嗯，了解」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_8ef359f3:



    voice "2RI_0553"
    rin "「其实，群里能收到的人只有我。阳菜用的是翻盖机，圣夜夜都没有手机」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_4703693f:


    "两个人露出了恍然大悟的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_010cfa91:



    voice "2SA_0230"
    sachiko "「啊，还有一件事。等放学之后也行，我想拜托一个人来扫一下屋顶上的雪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_1c9e69b9:



    voice "2HI_0537"
    hina "「啊，宿舍会被雪压塌吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_c44cb16b:



    voice "2SA_0231"
    sachiko "「又不是会下暴雪的地方。毕竟房子很旧了，漏水的话很恐怖吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_294ca117:



    voice "2RI_0554"
    rin "「真的是到处都破破烂烂的啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_7a02db2d:



    voice "2SA_0232"
    sachiko "「并不是真的让你去扫雪，只是把边缘的积雪扫走这种简单工作」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_d856a393:



    voice "2MI_0386"
    miyako "「我来帮忙」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_5ca89167:


    "圣夜子举起了手。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_e6c96c51:



    voice "2SA_0233"
    sachiko "「哦，thank you 圣夜夜」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_08fef3b1:



    voice "2FU_0469"
    fumi "「那放学后我们去采购，圣夜子先回去帮忙吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_c2bf0151:



    voice "2MI_0387"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_0e20551d:



    voice "2SA_0234"
    sachiko "「帮我大忙了，谢了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_718b005d:



    voice "2RI_0555"
    rin "「啊，不知不觉中巴士是不是要来了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_89f45042:



    voice "2FU_0470"
    fumi "「啊，真的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_17dd71f9:



    voice "2HI_0538"
    hina "「快点！我都听到巴士的声音了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_b2191c8f:



    voice "2SA_0235"
    sachiko "「耳朵真灵啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_82fc093c:


    "四个人跑了出去。"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_11ff3c45:



    voice "2SA_0236"
    sachiko "「别摔跤了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_9c14b8e8:



    voice "2HI_0539"
    hina "「啊啊啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_9d078bf5:



    voice "2SA_0237"
    sachiko "「…………」"




translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_f2d16562:


    voice "2HI_0532"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_4a4ae6ea:


    hina "「去上课！」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_cfce38b9:


    voice "2SA_0230"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_ca399b3d:


    sachiko "「啊，还有一件事。等下课之后也行，我想拜托一个人来扫一下屋顶上的雪」"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_bdd0173b:


    voice "2FU_0469"


translate simplified_chinese a08_comn_08_4409b068:


    fumi "「那放学后我们去采购，圣夜子先回去帮忙吧」"
